{
  "_comment": [
    "Every benchmark number Mahoraga publishes, bound to the committed per-case",
    "artifact it was computed from. `orch bench verify` recomputes each metric",
    "and requires it to round to exactly the value below, at the decimal place",
    "shown. CI runs it, so a headline number cannot drift from its data.",
    "",
    "Adding a claim here is how a number becomes publishable: if it is not in",
    "this file with an artifact behind it, it does not go in the README.",
    "`published_in` records where the number is quoted, so a failure points at",
    "the prose that needs fixing."
  ],
